<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>NP Photonics’ lasers power high-volume OEM programs in sensing, defense, metrology and research, in mission-critical industrial and scientific systems around the world.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"className":"caps"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group caps"><!-- wp:html -->
<div class="cap"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 56 56"><path d="M4 34c8 0 8-10 16-10s8 10 16 10 8-10 16-10"></path><circle class="f" cx="20" cy="24" r="2.6"></circle><path class="a" d="M4 44h48"></path></svg><h3 data-r="">Fiber-optic sensing</h3><p data-r="">The ROCK fiber laser is core technology for fiber-optic sensing systems, enabling 24/7 distributed monitoring of oil and gas pipelines.</p></div>
<!-- /wp:html -->
<!-- wp:html -->
<div class="cap"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 56 56"><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="6"></circle><ellipse cx="28" cy="28" rx="22" ry="9"></ellipse><ellipse class="a" cx="28" cy="28" rx="22" ry="9" transform="rotate(60 28 28)"></ellipse></svg><h3 data-r="">Quantum computing</h3><p data-r="">A preferred source for qubit excitation, with ultra-stable, frequency-locked operation across a range of wavelengths.</p></div>
<!-- /wp:html -->
<!-- wp:html -->
<div class="cap"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 56 56"><path d="M6 40h44M10 40v-6M18 40v-4M26 40v-6M34 40v-4M42 40v-6"></path><path class="a" d="M6 22h44"></path><path d="M44 17l6 5-6 5"></path></svg><h3 data-r="">Precision metrology</h3><p data-r="">The POWER ROCK high-power single-frequency laser serves precision metrology, nanometer-scale positioning and advanced semiconductor manufacturing.</p></div>
<!-- /wp:html -->
<!-- wp:html -->
<div class="cap"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 56 56"><rect height="16" width="14" x="6" y="20"></rect><rect height="24" width="22" x="28" y="16"></rect><path class="a" d="M20 28h8"></path></svg><h3 data-r="">Injection seeding</h3><p data-r="">The ROCK injection seeder is an industry-standard source for high-power Nd:YAG lasers, used in holography, narrow-linewidth pumping and Doppler lidar.</p></div>
<!-- /wp:html -->
<!-- wp:html -->
<div class="cap"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 56 56"><path d="M8 44l12-30"></path><path class="a" d="M20 14l30-6"></path><path d="M28 28c6 0 6 4 12 4s6-4 12-4M24 36c6 0 6 4 12 4s6-4 12-4"></path></svg><h3 data-r="">Doppler wind lidar</h3><p data-r="">The METEOR pulsed laser enables coherent Doppler sensing, deployed at commercial airports worldwide for wind shear detection.</p></div>
<!-- /wp:html -->
<!-- wp:html -->
<div class="cap"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 56 56"><path d="M6 40c6-20 12-20 18 0s12 20 18 0"></path><path class="a" d="M6 16h44"></path><circle class="f" cx="48" cy="16" r="2.6"></circle></svg><h3 data-r="">Mid-infrared</h3><p data-r="">Tellurite fiber technology for broadband supercontinuum fiber lasers and next-generation IR components for science, defense and industry.</p></div>
<!-- /wp:html --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->

